## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema3 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,3,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema8 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M5,8,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double sar = iSAR(NULL,PERIOD_M5,0.02,0.2,1)`
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_M5,12,26,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- `double stoch_main = iStochastic(NULL,PERIOD_M5,10,15,15,MODE_SMA,STO_LOWHIGH,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- `double stoch_sig = iStochastic(NULL,PERIOD_M5,10,15,15,MODE_SMA,STO_LOWHIGH,MODE_SIGNAL,1)`
- `double stoch_main_prev = iStochastic(...,2)`, `double stoch_sig_prev = iStochastic(...,MODE_SIGNAL,2)`
- Stoch cross up: `stoch_main > stoch_sig && stoch_main_prev <= stoch_sig_prev`
- `double sd = iStdDev(NULL,PERIOD_M5,20,0,MODE_SMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- SD threshold per symbol: detect instrument family from _Symbol, apply appropriate medium threshold
- SL: `iLowest(NULL,PERIOD_M5,MODE_LOW,5,2)` bar → SL at that low
- TP: `entry + 2.0 * iATR(NULL,PERIOD_M5,14,0)`
- P3 sweeps: SD filter on/off, SD threshold (medium vs strong), ATR SL multiplier, MACD threshold (0 vs negative/positive confirmation)

